{"headword":"מִרְמָה³","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f. deceit, treachery</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 8:5\" href=\"/Amos.8.5\">Am 8:5</a> +; pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִרְמוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:7\" href=\"/Psalms.10.7\">ψ 10:7</a> +;—<em>deceit</em>, of balances, <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹאזְנֵי מ׳</span> i.e. <em>deceptive balances</em> <a data-ref=\"Amos 8:5\" href=\"/Amos.8.5\">Am 8:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁקֶר</span>), <a data-ref=\"Hosea 12:8\" href=\"/Hosea.12.8\">Ho 12:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.1\">Pr 11:1</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבֶן שְׁלֵמָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.23\">20:23</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אַבְנֵי מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 6:11\" href=\"/Micah.6.11\">Mi 6:11</a> (v. [<a data-ref=\"BDB, מאזן\" href=\"/BDB,_מאזן\", dir=\"rtl\">מאזן</a>] p. 24); especially <em>treachery, craftiness</em>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:23\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.23\">2 K 9:23</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּמ׳</span> <em>treacherously</em>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:35\" href=\"/Genesis.27.35\">Gn 27:35</a> (J), and (of crafty speech) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:13\" href=\"/Genesis.34.13\">34:13</a> (P); <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂפְתֵי מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 17:1\" href=\"/Psalms.17.1\">ψ 17:1</a> i.e. <em>treacherous lips</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לְשׁוֹן מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 52:6\" href=\"/Psalms.52.6\">52:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּי מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:2\" href=\"/Psalms.109.2\">109:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">לְשׁוֹן שָׁ֑קֶר</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּבְרֵי מִרְמוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:20\" href=\"/Psalms.35.20\">35:20</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נִשְׁבַע לְמ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 24:4\" href=\"/Psalms.24.4\">ψ 24:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">לַשָּׁוְא</span>); cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 53:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.53.9\">Is 53:9</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חָמָם</span>); also <a data-ref=\"Hosea 12:1\" href=\"/Hosea.12.1\">Ho 12:1</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּחַשׁ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:27\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.27\">Je 5:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.5\">9:5</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.7\">7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 1:9\" href=\"/Zephaniah.1.9\">Zp 1:9</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">חָמָם</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:7\" href=\"/Psalms.10.7\">ψ 10:7</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">תֹּךְ</span>, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עָמָל וָאָוֶן</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 34:14\" href=\"/Psalms.34.14\">34:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 36:4\" href=\"/Psalms.36.4\">36:4</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">אָוֶן</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 38:13\" href=\"/Psalms.38.13\">38:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 50:19\" href=\"/Psalms.50.19\">50:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:12\" href=\"/Psalms.55.12\">55:12</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">תֹּךְ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Job 15:35\" href=\"/Job.15.35\">Jb 15:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 31:5\" href=\"/Job.31.5\">31:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁוְא</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.20\">Pr 12:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.8\">14:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.24\">26:24</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:25\" href=\"/Daniel.8.25\">Dn 8:25</a>; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁפָּט</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.5\">Pr 12:5</a>, + <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵד שְׁקָרִים</span> v <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.17\">17</a>, + <span dir=\"rtl\">יָפִחַ כְּזָבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:25\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.25\">14:25</a> (Hi Wild Toy read <span dir=\"rtl\">מְדַמֶּה</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">מרמה</span>, but II. <span dir=\"rtl\">דמה</span> not elsewhere Pi); <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ דָּמִים וּמ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 5:7\" href=\"/Psalms.5.7\">ψ 5:7</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דֹּבְרֵי כָזָב</span>), cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:24\" href=\"/Psalms.55.24\">5